flowchart TD
    A[Doctor Login] --> B{Account Activated?}
    B -->|No| C[Account Pending<br/>Contact Clinic Owner]
    B -->|Yes| D[Dashboard]
    
    %% Dashboard
    D --> D1[Today's Appointments Panel<br/>Dynamic list view]
    D1 --> D1a[Patient Profile Click<br/>Opens patient record]
    D1 --> D1b[Start Consultation Button<br/>Launches consultation session]
    D1 --> D1c[View Details Button<br/>Appointment detail modal]
    D1c --> D1c1[Appointment Detail Modal<br/>Patient info/Time/Status/Notes]
