    D1c1 --> D1c1b[Add Pre-consultation Notes<br/>Notes editor modal]
    D1c1 --> D1c1c[Start Consultation Button<br/>Begin session]
    
    D --> D2[Pending Consultations Summary<br/>Next 3 upcoming + missed]
    D2 --> D2a[No-show Alert<br/>Follow-up required notification]
    D2 --> D2b[Missed Consultation Alert<br/>24+ hour unresolved warning]
    
    D --> D3[Quick Access Widgets<br/>Recent patients & stats]
    D3 --> D3a[Recent Patients Tiles<br/>Name/Date/Quick actions]
    D3a --> D3a1[Add Notes Button<br/>Quick notes editor]
